key.description:
JSON array of remembered output (playback) devices, ordered by rank.
Index 0 is the highest priority. Each entry is {"key": "...", "label": "...", "hidden": bool};
hidden devices are removed from the GNOME Shell Quick Settings menu.

JSON array of remembered input (recording) devices, ordered by rank.
Index 0 is the highest priority. Each entry is {"key": "...", "label": "...", "hidden": bool};
hidden devices are removed from the GNOME Shell Quick Settings menu.
